orm of a letter，", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5298, "y": 0.5349, "w": 0.1992, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "document, etc. （that", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.731, "y": 0.5363, "w": 0.1704, "h": 0.0116}, {"t": "光发愁无济于事，我们必须采取", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.2567, "y": 0.5392, "w": 0.232, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "gives proof of sth）以书面形式（作为凭证）：AIL", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5298, "y": 0.5478, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0148}, {"t": "'hand-wringing noun: No amount of", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.191, "y": 0.5523, "w": 0.3039, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "telephone reservations must be confirmed in", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5318, "y": 0.5625, "w": 0.3696, "h": 0.0133}, {"t": "hand-wringing can change the situation. 再怎么", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.5668, "w": 0.3737, "h": 0.0132}, {"t": "writing. 所有的电话预约必须以书面形式确认。。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5298, "y": 0.5756, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "着急也改变不了局面。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1232, "y": 0.5799, "w": 0.1561, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "You should get his promises in writing. 你一定要", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5298, "y": 0.5901, "w": 0.3696, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "，wring sb's'neck （spoken, informal）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.117, "y": 0.5974, "w": 0.2793, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "得到他的书面许诺。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.5318, "y": 0.6032, "w": 0.1417, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "used as an expression of anger or as a threat", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1232, "y": 0.6119, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0117}, {"t": "the,writing （is） on the \"wall （AmE the,hand-", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.5318, "y": 0.6206, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "（表示愤怒或威胁）柠断⋯的脖子，掐死⋯：矿1", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.1294, "y": 0.625, "w": 0.3655, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "writing （is） on the 'wall） （saying）", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.5318, "y": 0.6352, "w": 0.2505, "h": 0.0132}, {"t": "find the person who did this, Tl wring his neck！", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.117, "y": 0.6395, "w": 0.3778, "h": 0.0148}, {"t": "used when you are describing a situation in", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5298, "y": 0.6483, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "要是我查出是谁干的，非拧断他脖子不可！", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.6526, "w": 0.308, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "which there are signs that sb/sth i